[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4501.47, "timestamp": "01:15:01", "text": "この連合は、ユーチューバーの名前です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4504.83, "timestamp": "01:15:04", "text": "連合軍の彼は本当にクールだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4508.229, "timestamp": "01:15:08", "text": "システム。彼らには子供がいる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4510.95, "timestamp": "01:15:10", "text": "ポイントみたいなもの、トークンみたいなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4513.43, "timestamp": "01:15:13", "text": "店。これはTwitchチャット用です。それ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4515.35, "timestamp": "01:15:15", "text": "文字通りYouTubeとGoogleと書いてある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4516.43, "timestamp": "01:15:16", "text": "サポートは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4519.83, "timestamp": "01:15:19", "text": "来るよ。うん、これはいいね。あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4522.07, "timestamp": "01:15:22", "text": "できることの多さは尋常じゃない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4526.229, "timestamp": "01:15:26", "text": "それだけではなく、それだけではなく、えっと、彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4529.99, "timestamp": "01:15:29", "text": "実績システムボードチャットのようなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4532.55, "timestamp": "01:15:32", "text": "あれ。 YouTubeを見ることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4535.83, "timestamp": "01:15:35", "text": "またはTwitchで視聴できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4539.75, "timestamp": "01:15:39", "text": "ウェブサイト自体からのストリーム"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4542.31, "timestamp": "01:15:42", "text": "TwitchとYouTubeのチャットリプレイ。彼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4544.79, "timestamp": "01:15:44", "text": "ここにはYouTubeはありませんが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4546.11, "timestamp": "01:15:46", "text": "えーと、これは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4549.47, "timestamp": "01:15:49", "text": "うん、それはいいね。いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4553.27, "timestamp": "01:15:53", "text": "そして彼はモバイルアプリも持っていて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4556.47, "timestamp": "01:15:56", "text": "彼の配信やブログに関する最新情報"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4557.27, "timestamp": "01:15:57", "author": "@KosmikZethar", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b_m56i87DkQCW